/- English proof (translation)
Extract witnesses or component facts from the available result. Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Assume the negation of the conclusion and derive a contradiction.

